<title>USA: Ford February US car sales fall. [CORRECTED 23:44 GMT]</title>
<headline>Ford February US car sales fall. [CORRECTED 23:44 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>DETROIT 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ford Motor Co</p>
<p>			Feb 1-28, 1997     Feb 1-29, 1996 *Pct Chng</p>
<p> Domestic Car	   126,660	   141,961	     -7.1</p>
<p>(Corrects year-ago figure to 141,961 from 137,336. Corrects percentage figure to -7.1 from -3.9)</p>
<p> Domestic Truck	 163,117	   167,402	     +1.5</p>
<p> Import Car		 2,285	     4,860	    -51.0</p>
<p>(Corrects year-ago figure to 4,860 from 9,485. Corrects percentage figure to -51.0 from -74.9).</p>
<p> Import Truck		   0		   0	     N.A.</p>
<p>		  Jan 1-Feb 28, 1997 Jan 1-Feb 29, 1996 *Pct Chng</p>
<p> Domestic Car	   240,596	   265,958	     -7.7</p>
<p>(Corrects year-ago figure to 265,958 from 261,333. Corrects percentage figure to -7.7 from -6.1)</p>
<p> Domestic Truck	 324,533	   309,481	     +7.0</p>
<p> Import Car		 4,144	     8,363	    -49.5</p>
<p>(Corrects year-ago figure to 8,363 from 12,988. Corrects percentage figure to -49.5 from -67.5)</p>
<p> Import Truck		   0		   0	     N.A.</p>
<p>* Pct change based on daily selling rate. Sale days 24 in latest month vs 25, 50 for year to date vs 51 in year ago.</p>
</text>
